<p id=3D"mwEw">A <b id=3D"mwFA">web browser</b>, often abbreviated as <b id=
=3D"mwFQ">browser</b>, is an <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wiki=
pedia.org/wiki/Application_software" title=3D"Application software" id=3D"m=
wFg">application</a> for accessing <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://e=
n.wikipedia.org/wiki/Website" title=3D"Website" id=3D"mwFw">websites</a>. W=
hen a <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User_(co=
mputing)" title=3D"User (computing)" id=3D"mwGA">user</a> requests a <a rel=
=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Web_page" title=3D"W=
eb page" id=3D"mwGQ">web page</a> from a particular website, the browser re=
trieves its <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Co=
mputer_file" title=3D"Computer file" id=3D"mwGg">files</a> from a <a rel=3D=
"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Web_server" title=3D"We=
b server" id=3D"mwGw">web server</a> and then displays the page on the user=
's screen. Browsers can also display content stored locally on the user's d=
evice.</p>

<p id=3D"mwHA">Browsers are used on a range of devices, including <a rel=3D=
"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Desktop_computer" title=
=3D"Desktop computer" id=3D"mwHQ">desktops</a>, <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=
=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Laptop" title=3D"Laptop" id=3D"mwHg">lapt=
ops</a>, <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Table=
t_computer" title=3D"Tablet computer" id=3D"mwHw">tablets</a>, <a rel=3D"mw=
:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Smartphone" title=3D"Smart=
phone" id=3D"mwIA">smartphones</a>, <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://=
en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Smartwatch" title=3D"Smartwatch" id=3D"mwIQ">smartwat=
ches</a>, <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Smar=
t_TV" title=3D"Smart TV" id=3D"mwIg">smart televisions</a> and <a rel=3D"mw=
:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Video_game_console" title=
=3D"Video game console" id=3D"mwIw">consoles</a>.<sup about=3D"#mwt9" class=
=3D"mw-ref reference" id=3D"cite_ref-1" rel=3D"dc:references" typeof=3D"mw:=
Extension/ref" data-mw=3D"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quo=
