e)" title=3D"Tab (interface)" id=3D"mwATg">tabs</a> of the same window.</li=
>
<li id=3D"mwATk"><i id=3D"mwATo">Back</i> and <i id=3D"mwATs">forward</i> b=
uttons to go back to the previous page visited or forward to the next one.<=
/li>
<li id=3D"mwATw">A <i id=3D"mwAT0">refresh</i> or <i id=3D"mwAT4">reload</i=
> and a <i id=3D"mwAT8">stop</i> button to reload and cancel loading the cu=
rrent page. (In most browsers, the stop button is merged with the reload bu=
tton.)</li>
<li id=3D"mwAUA">A <i id=3D"mwAUE">home</i> button to return to the <a rel=
