Home page" id=3D"mwAUI">start page</a>.</li>
<li id=3D"mwAUM">An address bar to input the <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D=
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/URL" title=3D"URL" id=3D"mwAUQ">URL</a> of a=
 page and display it, and a search bar to input <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=
=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Web_query" title=3D"Web query" id=3D"mwAU=
U">queries</a> into a <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.o=
rg/wiki/Search_engine" title=3D"Search engine" id=3D"mwAUY">search engine</=
a>. (In most browsers, the search bar is merged with the address bar.)</li>=
</ul>

