<section data-mw-section-id=3D"5" id=3D"mwAlk" aria-labelledby=3D"Market_sh=
are_by_type_of_device"><div class=3D"mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id=3D"Mark=
et_share_by_type_of_device">Market share by type of device</h3></div>
<p id=3D"mwAlo">Prior to late 2016, the majority of web traffic came from d=
esktop computers. However, <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"https://en.wikipe=
dia.org/wiki/Usage_share_of_web_browsers#Crossover_to_smartphones_having_ma=
jority_share" title=3D"Usage share of web browsers" id=3D"mwAls">since then=
</a>, mobile devices (smartphones) have represented the majority of web tra=
ffic.<sup about=3D"#mwt166" class=3D"mw-ref reference" id=3D"cite_ref-StatC=
ounterMobile2016_41-0" rel=3D"dc:references" typeof=3D"mw:Extension/ref" da=
ta-mw=3D"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;name&qu=
ot;:&quot;StatCounterMobile2016&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&qu=
ot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-StatCounterMobile2016-41&quot;}}"><a href=3D=
"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Web_browser#cite_note-StatCounterMobile2016-=
41" id=3D"mwAlw"><span class=3D"mw-reflink-text" id=3D"mwAl0"><span class=
=3D"cite-bracket" id=3D"mwAl4">[</span>41<span class=3D"cite-bracket" id=3D=
"mwAl8">]</span></span></a></sup> As of February 2025, mobile devices repre=
sent a 62% share of Internet traffic, followed by desktop at 36% and tablet=
 at 2%.<sup about=3D"#mwt169" class=3D"mw-ref reference" id=3D"cite_ref-Sta=
tCounterDeviceUsageRecent_42-0" rel=3D"dc:references" typeof=3D"mw:Extensio=
n/ref" data-mw=3D"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quo=
t;name&quot;:&quot;StatCounterDeviceUsageRecent&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&q=
uot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-reference-text-cite_note-StatCounterDeviceUsageRecent=
-42&quot;}}"><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Web_browser#cite_note=
-StatCounterDeviceUsageRecent-42" id=3D"mwAmA"><span class=3D"mw-reflink-te=
xt" id=3D"mwAmE"><span class=3D"cite-bracket" id=3D"mwAmI">[</span>42<span =
class=3D"cite-bracket" id=3D"mwAmM">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

