ng</a></div>

<p id=3D"mwAnU">During the course of browsing, <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=
=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/HTTP_cookie" title=3D"HTTP cookie" id=3D"=
mwAnY">cookies</a> received from various <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=3D"htt=
ps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Website" title=3D"Website" id=3D"mwAnc">websites=
</a> are stored by the browser. Some of them contain login credentials or s=
ite preferences.<sup about=3D"#mwt179" class=3D"mw-ref reference" id=3D"cit=
e_ref-tom's_guide_44-0" rel=3D"dc:references" typeof=3D"mw:Extension/ref" d=
ata-mw=3D"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;name&q=
uot;:&quot;tom's guide&quot;},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;mw-ref=
erence-text-cite_note-tom's_guide-44&quot;}}"><a href=3D"https://en.wikiped=
ia.org/wiki/Web_browser#cite_note-tom's_guide-44" id=3D"mwAng"><span class=
=3D"mw-reflink-text" id=3D"mwAnk"><span class=3D"cite-bracket" id=3D"mwAno"=
>[</span>44<span class=3D"cite-bracket" id=3D"mwAns">]</span></span></a></s=
up> However, others are used for tracking user behavior over long periods o=
f time, so browsers typically provide a section in the menu for deleting co=
okies.<sup about=3D"#mwt180" class=3D"mw-ref reference" id=3D"cite_ref-tom'=
s_guide_44-1" rel=3D"dc:references" typeof=3D"mw:Extension/ref" data-mw=3D"=
{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot=
;tom's guide&quot;}}"><a href=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Web_browser#=
cite_note-tom's_guide-44" id=3D"mwAnw"><span class=3D"mw-reflink-text" id=
=3D"mwAn0"><span class=3D"cite-bracket" id=3D"mwAn4">[</span>44<span class=
=3D"cite-bracket" id=3D"mwAn8">]</span></span></a></sup></p>=20

<p id=3D"mwAoA">Some browsers have more proactive protection against cookie=
s and trackers that limit their functionality and ability to track user beh=
aviour.<sup about=3D"#mwt183" class=3D"mw-ref reference" id=3D"cite_ref-45"=
 rel=3D"dc:references" typeof=3D"mw:Extension/ref" data-mw=3D"{&quot;name&q=
uot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{},&quot;body&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:=
