ia.org/wiki/Web_browser#cite_note-45" id=3D"mwAoE"><span class=3D"mw-reflin=
k-text" id=3D"mwAoI"><span class=3D"cite-bracket" id=3D"mwAoM">[</span>45<s=
pan class=3D"cite-bracket" id=3D"mwAoQ">]</span></span></a></sup> Finer-gra=
ined management of cookies usually requires a <a rel=3D"mw:WikiLink" href=
=3D"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Browser_extension" title=3D"Browser exten=
sion" id=3D"mwAoU">browser extension</a>.<sup about=3D"#mwt186" class=3D"mw=
-ref reference" id=3D"cite_ref-46" rel=3D"dc:references" typeof=3D"mw:Exten=
sion/ref" data-mw=3D"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;ref&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{}=
